{
    "title": "[69D] Magic Road 2",
    "description": "-IMPORTANT---------------------------\r\nIn case of problems with the installation of the watch face on your watch, please copy the link below and paste it into your web browser (not Google play app), there you will be able to choose the device on which watch face should be installed.\r\n\r\nLink:\r\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.sixty9design.magicroad2\r\n-------------------------------------\r\n\r\nPlease enjoy this outstanding watch face with many selection of customizable elements. \r\nA lot of possible designs combination!\r\nNow you can create your perfect combination which suits your taste.\r\n\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n- 18 color combinations\r\n- 3 different backgrounds\r\n- 12/24 hour format;\r\n- Battery level\r\n- Steps count \r\n- Date\r\n- 1 x Complication area \r\n\r\nNOTE:\r\nThis app is made for Wear OS devices.\r\nPlease select \"download on your watch device\" from the \"INSTALL\" drop-down menu.\r\n\r\nThis watch face is compatible with most Wear OS devices, but keep in mind that it will run best and smoothest on newer devices with latest Wear OS software versions.\r\n\r\nPlease note the attached instructions above (graphic images) which explain how to configure the watch face.\r\n\r\nThank you.\r\n69 Design\r\n\r\nFollow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/_69_design_/",
    "descriptionHTML": "-IMPORTANT---------------------------<br>In case of problems with the installation of the watch face on your watch, please copy the link below and paste it into your web browser (not Google play app), there you will be able to choose the device on which watch face should be installed.<br><br>Link:<br>https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.sixty9design.magicroad2<br>-------------------------------------<br><br>Please enjoy this outstanding watch face with many selection of customizable elements. <br>A lot of possible designs combination!<br>Now you can create your perfect combination which suits your taste.<br><br><br>Features:<br>- 18 color combinations<br>- 3 different backgrounds<br>- 12/24 hour format;<br>- Battery level<br>- Steps count <br>- Date<br>- 1 x Complication area <br><br>NOTE:<br>This app is made for Wear OS devices.<br>Please select &quot;download on your watch device&quot; from the &quot;INSTALL&quot; drop-down menu.<br><br>This watch face is compatible with most Wear OS devices, but keep in mind that it will run best and smoothest on newer devices with latest Wear OS software versions.<br><br>Please note the attached instructions above (graphic images) which explain how to configure the watch face.<br><br>Thank you.<br>69 Design<br><br>Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/_69_design_/",
